    "intro_narrative": "You have finally breached the hidden study of the elusive cryptographer, Elias Thorne. The air is thick with dust, smelling faintly of old paper and ozone. A single beam of moonlight cuts through the boarded-up windows, illuminating a workspace cluttered with strange artifacts and bizarre machinery. Thorne was a master of hiding secrets within secrets, and legend says his ultimate prize—an unbreakable master encryption key—is still concealed somewhere within these walls. You know that simply breaking things open won't work; Thorne's security measures are ingenious and layered. You must carefully search the room, examining the bizarre devices and curious objects left behind. Your objective is clear: uncover the master key before Thorne's automated security systems lock the room down forever. Time is ticking.",
